  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FALG Brick Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The global environment objective of this project is to reduce the emissions of greenhouse gases by increasing the market penetration of a more climate-friendly brick manufacturing technology.  The development objectives of the project include the creation of business opportunities for small enterprises using a more climate-friendly technology, including the possibility of more stable employment for seasonal brick workers, and improving the environmental sustainability of construction materials in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
